"Glow Free AI needs no sign-in (shared, about one reply every 30 s); a free Puter sign-in or your own API key gives faster models.": "Glow Free AI tanpa masuk (dibagi bersama, sekitar satu balasan tiap 30 dtk); masuk Puter gratis atau kunci API sendiri memberi model lebih cepat.",
