"Glow Offline stopped. The device may have run out of memory; try again or use Glow Offline Mini.": "Glow Offline berhenti. Mungkin memori perangkat habis; coba lagi atau pakai Glow Offline Mini.",
"Glow Offline: download a small AI model once (from 0.3 GB) in GlowChat → Settings → Offline AI on this device, and GlowChat keeps answering with no internet. It runs on your device's graphics chip and nothing you type leaves the device.": "Glow Offline: unduh model AI kecil sekali saja (mulai 0,3 GB) di GlowChat → Pengaturan → AI offline di perangkat ini, dan GlowChat tetap menjawab tanpa internet. Model berjalan di chip grafis perangkatmu dan apa pun yang kamu ketik tidak keluar dari perangkat.",
